# Allowlist the build context. Runtime data, keys, local .venv and VCS never enter it.
**
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!src/
!src/**
!migrations/
!migrations/**
!third_party/
!third_party/mobile_agent/
!third_party/mobile_agent/manifest.json
!third_party/mobile_agent/upstream/
